  "extension": {
    "kind": "additive-component-reference",
    "purpose": "Frozen CLI reference for the AntD InputNumber component used by the tianshu-device-ops 2026-09-29 batch-2 pages (阈值 / 离线天数 / 重试上限等数值输入). No new decision cards: InputNumber is a bounded numeric input; base batch-1 manifest stays byte-identical.",
